{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A border town in chaos\u2014fields lie barren, beggars collapse on the streets, while bandits and tax collectors alike prey on the weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the ruined tavern, only broken chairs and dust remain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two kingdoms both claim this land, and the winds of war are blowing toward the town. A letter from the village elder arrives: your grandfather\u2019s tavern has been seized. You decide to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aA Kingdom of Soil\u300b</strong> is a pixel-art medieval RPG and management adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a returning heir, rebuilding your family\u2019s legacy amidst turmoil, uncovering buried secrets, and forging your own legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the main story unfolds, you will uncover the mysteries of the tavern and the town, while freely choosing your own way of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyday Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow the soil, sow and harvest, fish and hunt\u2026 The land is not only your means of survival, but the very foundation of your rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/9a9d90155b31fa50a6b03bf91c0dfeee.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/9a9d90155b31fa50a6b03bf91c0dfeee.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/9a9d90155b31fa50a6b03bf91c0dfeee.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and Influence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, cook meals, brew ale, craft works of art\u2014every skill can earn you wealth or favors.<br>Deal with all kinds of people using negotiation, intimidation, deception, or charm. Your reputation can open doors\u2014or create enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonds and Companionship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though morals decay and society crumbles, you may still form true bonds with the townsfolk, build a family, and even grow old together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During festivals, the tavern fills with light. Even with war looming, people will still raise their cups and celebrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to thrive in the medieval world?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, steal, and assassinate\u2014plan daring heists in the dark with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One successful strike may make you rich, but it may also turn everyone\u2019s eyes against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a righteous outlaw, or a ruthless brigand? The <strong>choice</strong> is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/504678bb94bdf51f7923190d76f271b2.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/504678bb94bdf51f7923190d76f271b2.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/504678bb94bdf51f7923190d76f271b2.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c0d80a8b149dad29798a6c832e2ef889.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c0d80a8b149dad29798a6c832e2ef889.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c0d80a8b149dad29798a6c832e2ef889.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild Your Tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFriend! Have another drink!\u201d Stoke the fire, repair rooms, refresh the menu, hear new stories, take on quests, and hire help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tavern reopens, many will stop by\u2014some bringing wealth and songs, others bringing plots and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/fe60057dec8a98c6bfe51292e9cb10fa.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/fe60057dec8a98c6bfe51292e9cb10fa.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/fe60057dec8a98c6bfe51292e9cb10fa.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power and Intrigue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the clinking of cups, nobles and politicians will arrive at your tavern.<br>Some truly strive for peace, seeking to prevent war and improve lives.<br>Others are deceitful and greedy, ignoring suffering while clinging to the old order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the table, will you listen and assist, subtly shaping events?<br>Or remain silent, seeking only to endure these troubled times?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Final Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally recover your grandfather\u2019s recipe,<strong> </strong>the <strong><i><u>Legendary Brew</u></i> </strong>returns to the world<strong>.</strong><br>The old tavern once again becomes a beacon in chaos, gathering both hearts and ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the glow of cups and candlelight, there is wealth and song, but also schemes and suspicion.<br>And now, fate rests upon your shoulders:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carry forward the old family name, letting its legacy echo in every cup?<br>Or sever the past entirely, and carve a new epic of your own?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991390?t=1773945896","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991390?t=1773945896","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/3b723388fcad9b52c620624c42e760cfd662b9ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773945896","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/3b723388fcad9b52c620624c42e760cfd662b9ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773945896","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About the Developer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/f803085ad03f8f2ad2844c7f0ac5cc3d.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1560 height=504 /></span>The crowdfunding campaign is now live on <strong>Afdian</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While support is greatly appreciated, it won\u2019t affect the ongoing development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development of <i>A Kingdom of Soil</i> began in May 2025, and the creator is now working full-time on the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community to get the latest updates and behind-the-scenes news:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 Dev (X/Twitter): <strong><i><u>@NicoDocci</u></i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 Official (X/Twitter):<u><i><strong>@AKingdomofSoil</strong></i></u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Discord: <u><i><strong></strong></i></u></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A border town in chaos\u2014fields lie barren, beggars collapse on the streets, while bandits and tax collectors alike prey on the weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the ruined tavern, only broken chairs and dust remain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two kingdoms both claim this land, and the winds of war are blowing toward the town. A letter from the village elder arrives: your grandfather\u2019s tavern has been seized. You decide to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aA Kingdom of Soil\u300b</strong> is a pixel-art medieval RPG and management adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a returning heir, rebuilding your family\u2019s legacy amidst turmoil, uncovering buried secrets, and forging your own legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the main story unfolds, you will uncover the mysteries of the tavern and the town, while freely choosing your own way of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyday Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow the soil, sow and harvest, fish and hunt\u2026 The land is not only your means of survival, but the very foundation of your rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/9a9d90155b31fa50a6b03bf91c0dfeee.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/9a9d90155b31fa50a6b03bf91c0dfeee.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/9a9d90155b31fa50a6b03bf91c0dfeee.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and Influence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, cook meals, brew ale, craft works of art\u2014every skill can earn you wealth or favors.<br>Deal with all kinds of people using negotiation, intimidation, deception, or charm. Your reputation can open doors\u2014or create enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonds and Companionship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though morals decay and society crumbles, you may still form true bonds with the townsfolk, build a family, and even grow old together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During festivals, the tavern fills with light. Even with war looming, people will still raise their cups and celebrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/ebc44067c30645a53c1b307d67936e02.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to thrive in the medieval world?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, steal, and assassinate\u2014plan daring heists in the dark with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One successful strike may make you rich, but it may also turn everyone\u2019s eyes against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a righteous outlaw, or a ruthless brigand? The <strong>choice</strong> is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/504678bb94bdf51f7923190d76f271b2.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/504678bb94bdf51f7923190d76f271b2.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/504678bb94bdf51f7923190d76f271b2.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c0d80a8b149dad29798a6c832e2ef889.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c0d80a8b149dad29798a6c832e2ef889.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/c0d80a8b149dad29798a6c832e2ef889.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild Your Tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFriend! Have another drink!\u201d Stoke the fire, repair rooms, refresh the menu, hear new stories, take on quests, and hire help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tavern reopens, many will stop by\u2014some bringing wealth and songs, others bringing plots and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/fe60057dec8a98c6bfe51292e9cb10fa.poster.avif?t=1773945896\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/fe60057dec8a98c6bfe51292e9cb10fa.webm?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/fe60057dec8a98c6bfe51292e9cb10fa.mp4?t=1773945896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power and Intrigue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the clinking of cups, nobles and politicians will arrive at your tavern.<br>Some truly strive for peace, seeking to prevent war and improve lives.<br>Others are deceitful and greedy, ignoring suffering while clinging to the old order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the table, will you listen and assist, subtly shaping events?<br>Or remain silent, seeking only to endure these troubled times?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Final Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally recover your grandfather\u2019s recipe,<strong> </strong>the <strong><i><u>Legendary Brew</u></i> </strong>returns to the world<strong>.</strong><br>The old tavern once again becomes a beacon in chaos, gathering both hearts and ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the glow of cups and candlelight, there is wealth and song, but also schemes and suspicion.<br>And now, fate rests upon your shoulders:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carry forward the old family name, letting its legacy echo in every cup?<br>Or sever the past entirely, and carve a new epic of your own?</p>","developers":["NicoDocci"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/5f3a65730acb2211413befa8d333c0b711b7a01c/header.jpg?t=1773945896","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991390/2055803562/ef4642e209c89526e0a2ca38f5ba35fd83dde9cf/1757265643/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757269016","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991390/2055803562/ef4642e209c89526e0a2ca38f5ba35fd83dde9cf/1757265643/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757269016","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991390/2055803562/ef4642e209c89526e0a2ca38f5ba35fd83dde9cf/1757265643/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757269016","id":257194293,"name":"A Kingdom of Soil \u2013 Teaser (EN)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194293/97581bdca5e0d090c48fd4f2ff7c6a880cb392e4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757269016"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991390/1047005301/bea2da7c1d653ec3c1d71500174578bbd11c964e/1760752425/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760762580","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991390/1047005301/bea2da7c1d653ec3c1d71500174578bbd11c964e/1760752425/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760762580","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/39913